        "contenuto_esteso": "In an interview with FRANCE 24, US Trade Representative Jamieson Greer insisted that despite fresh US tariffs proposed this Wednesday, \"both sides are committed to compliance\" with the US-EU trade deal. The top US trade official said he saw \"a lot of room\" for continued compliance, notwithstanding Washington's new tariff proposals on imports of goods produced using forced labour."
