        "contenuto_esteso": "🍂 Plus: Trump’s first big 2026 midterm loss {beacon} It’s Wednesday. We are in such a good stretch of sports. The French Open is happening, the World Cup starts next week (!) and Wimbledon is coming up. Plus, we get to see Serena Williams’s return to professional tennis. (Editor's note: the NBA and NHL..."
